WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.310
Here's how to make a macro in PadForge.

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.430
This one saves a screenshot when you click the DualSense's touchpad.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.510
You're hearing a generated voice.

4
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.560
Open the controller, go to the Macros tab, and click Add.

5
00:00:16.388 --> 00:00:17.618
Name it Screenshot.

6
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.350
Under Trigger, open Add from List.

7
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.150
Below the Any Device group, the DualSense has its own inputs.

8
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.830
Pick Touchpad Click.

9
00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:32.283
Consume Trigger Buttons is on, so the game never sees that click.

10
00:00:32.953 --> 00:00:35.583
Fire stays On Press: one click, one run.

11
00:00:37.274 --> 00:00:40.304
Click Add Action, and change its type to Key Press.

12
00:00:41.945 --> 00:00:47.095
In Key Combo, type each key's name in curly braces: LWin, then PrintScreen.

13
00:00:48.495 --> 00:00:50.465
The macro saves as you go.

14
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:54.745
Click the touchpad, and Windows saves a screenshot to your Pictures folder.

15
00:00:55.983 --> 00:00:58.493
Find more guides at padforge.org.
